<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL - Cisco stems losses.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Cisco stems losses.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cisco Systems Inc shares firmed in busy pre-open trade Wednesday, rising 5/8 to 56-5/8 from last night's after-hours decline, which came after the company announced fiscal third quarter results, traders said.</p>
<p>During Tuesday's regular Nasdaq session, Cisco fell 1-1/8, to 57-3/4, then slid to 56 after the company said it earned $0.52 a share in the quarter ended last month, in-line with analysts' consensus view and up from $0.37 per share last year.</p>
</text>
